cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CordInsight in your research, please cite it as below, including the version you used."
type: software
title: "CordInsight: Zebrafish Behavioral Tracking"
abstract: >-
  CordInsight is a desktop application for tracking zebrafish (Danio rerio)
  movement in recorded video. Researchers draw a free-form arena and named
  observation zones, calibrate to real-world units, and measure time and
  entries per zone, distance traveled and speed. Results are exported to
  Excel, with a heatmap of where the animal spent its time. Tracking uses
  static-background subtraction, persistent contour tracking and offline
  gap reconstruction.
authors:
